WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.999
This is Life OS. my project knowledge workspace.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.999
I am developing it to keep project context organized as my engineering and software work evolves.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.999
The dashboard groups existing work into project spaces. rather than leaving everything in disconnected folders.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.999
The document library provides controls for connecting and indexing project documents. This shot shows the interface. not a completed indexing run.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.999
The agent workspace organizes tools by role. including research. documentation. and project review.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.999
Here I submit a research request and show its running state. I am not presenting that state as a completed answer.

7
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.999
The visual office brings the roles and recorded activity into one workspace.

8
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:55.999
My focus is systems thinking and project continuity. The workspace is local-first. while agent features can use optional cloud services and still need human review.

9
00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.999
This demo shows the current interface. not every planned workflow.
